            "post": {
                "operationId": "publicAgentTaskCreate",
                "description": "Run one autonomous agent turn for this brand.\n\n`command: \"prompt\"` takes a free-form `prompt`, the instruction the agent carries out (\"Add an About page with a team section\"). `command: \"build_page\"` takes an `opportunityRef` from the page-opportunities list and builds that page.\n\nA task takes about five minutes. Poll the task detail route every 30-60 seconds, or watch the chat thread the response links to.\n\n**One task at a time per brand.** A second create while one is running answers 409: the agent holds a single workspace per brand, so it runs tasks one after another rather than queuing them. Wait for the running task to settle, then submit the next one.\n\n**Idempotent retries.** Send an `Idempotency-Key` header to make a retry safe. For 24 hours, the same key with the same body answers 202 with the task it already started and an `Idempotent-Replayed: true` header; the same key with a different body answers 422.",
                "summary": "Start an agent task",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "in": "header",
                        "name": "Idempotency-Key",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "description": "A unique value per logical task, 1-255 printable characters (a UUID v4 works). Remembered for 24 hours per organization."
                    },
                    {
                        "in": "path",
                        "name": "brandSlug",
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string"
                        },
                        "required": true
                    }
                ],
                "tags": [
                    "Public: Tasks"
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublicAgentTaskCreate"
                            },
                            "examples": {
                                "AFree-formTask": {
                                    "value": {
                                        "command": "prompt",
                                        "prompt": "Add an About page with a team section."
                                    },
                                    "summary": "A free-form task"
                                },
                                "BuildAPageOpportunity": {
                                    "value": {
                                        "command": "build_page",
                                        "opportunityRef": "otel-cost-control-buyers-guide-3f2a91b4"
                                    },
                                    "summary": "Build a page opportunity"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "required": true
                },
                "security": [
                    {
                        "tenantApiKeyAuth": []
                    }
                ],
                "responses": {
                    "400": {
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
